==Battleground==
*1 [[Large White Ball]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Large White Ball]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[White Wind]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*15 [[Large White Ball]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 67.33 seconds<sup>2,020f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Large Iron Ball]]s spawn after 68.33 seconds<sup>2,050f</sup>, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*10 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 84.33 seconds<sup>2,530f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 86 seconds<sup>2,580f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try using anti-Red cats such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish Cat]] to stall the [[Large Red Ball]]s and [[Red Wind]]s spawning in the stage, and, to a lesser extent, the [[Large Iron Ball]]s because of Crazed Fish Cat's abysmal critical hit chance. Then, try using [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] to outrange the rest of the enemies in the stage. It's also advisable to use [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]] or either [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to brute-force the rest of the stage.

